  "notes": "Distinctive: the ongoing trip is shown as an oversized 'boarding pass' hero with a metallic grey gradient, giant two-line white title and a frosted ticket strip with dashed dividers and notch cutouts at the edges. Trip cards use vivid mesh-like gradients (cyan/teal, peach, lilac) instead of photos with bold white titles and circular translucent icon buttons (edit/duplicate/archive/delete) overlaid on the cover. Heavily rounded corners (22-32px) on all widget cards, very soft shadows. The first KPI tile is inverted (near-black) with stacked country-flag circles. Right aside widgets each have a tracked uppercase caption with a small line icon. Collections are rendered as full-width gradient pills with a translucent count badge. Nav is a segmented pill group centered in the header. Floating black pill 'New Trip' FAB bottom-right. Help is a page-scoped help center dialog (Dashboard guides, 'How do I…' cards)."
